ines whether a point is earned?","code_snippet":null,"options":["A condition","A file name","A string","A comment"],"placeholder":null,"hint":"Review the explanation and pseudocode example.","explanation":"Apply the idea, not a particular language's syntax.","sort_order":3},{"lesson_slug":"fund-mini-project","exercise_key":"fund-mini-project-q4","exercise_type":"text","eyebrow":"Complete the concept","prompt":"If three answers are correct, what is the final score?","code_snippet":null,"options":null,"placeholder":"Type your answer","hint":"Review the explanation and pseudocode example.","explanation":"Apply the idea, not a particular language's syntax.","sort_order":4}]$fund_exercises$::jsonb) as v(lesson_slug text,exercise_key text,exercise_type text,eyebrow text,prompt text,code_snippet text,options jsonb,placeholder text,hint text,explanation text,sort_order int)
